{"c":[{"id":"44e244aef3c74c04","sum":"Write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only (repeating membership would override a consumer's gate). Usage owns every argv it claims; fold_request prints the exact Run: line; Usage must not say Run:.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T164055Z-10a43354ce0f7523","text":"Creative: write rule lives only in init/AGENTS.md as editable policy; wake Usage is mechanics only; repeating membership on wake would override a consumer's gate.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T170414Z-a3069e4d545d0246","text":"Usage owns every argv it claims: note, nap ID-A ID-B CAPTION, recall, zoom, wake --path. fold_request still prints the exact Run: line; Usage must not say Run:","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"750292c631261ac3","sum":"prompt_text and write-rule wording are not pinned; only AGENTS.md prefix lockstep and init identity are. Prefix must not teach note/nap argv or Usage recipes; fold_request prints the exact Run: line; invoked as {AGENT_BIN} is not a recipe.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260829T204616Z-0c23f7c61b19009e","text":"prompt_text wording is not pinned; only AGENTS.md prefix lockstep and init identity. Prefix must not teach note/nap argv or Usage recipes.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260829T210418Z-1a2dc36f0829c667","text":"Usage does not teach nap argv; fold_request still prints the exact Run: line. Prefix may say invoked as {AGENT_BIN}; that is not a recipe. Write-rule wording is not pinned — AGENTS.md lockstep and init identity are.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
